window.SEARCH_INDEX=[{"url": ".", "title": "Starwell Holdings", "text": "Dream with Starwell. Starwell Holdings is a private holding company with operating activities in IT services and real estate, alongside passive capital allocation to public markets and alternative assets. ↓ What We Do IT Services Acquiring and operating IT Services businesses. Learn More → Real Estate Development and GP investments in Israel, select co-investments. Learn More → Capital Long-term investment portfolio across public markets and direct private positions. Learn More → About Starwell Learn more about Starwell Starwell Holdings is a private holding company with operating activities in IT services and real estate, alongside passive capital allocation to public markets and alternative assets - a long-term, owner-led approach. Learn more about Starwell →"}, {"url": "our-story", "title": "About Us", "text": "About Us Starwell Holdings Starwell Holdings is a private holding company. We build and acquire operating businesses in IT services, invest in and develop real estate, and allocate capital to public markets and alternative investments. Beyond capital allocation, Starwell acts as a long-term owner and active partner - acquiring companies, scaling platforms, and working alongside management teams to develop durable businesses and real assets. Our approach combines entrepreneurial execution with disciplined investment principles. We focus on opportunities where long-term ownership, operational involvement, and alignment with partners can create enduring value across cycles and generations. Starwell Holdings was founded by Amit Kochavi, who serves as Chairman and CEO. Meet the team → Business Focus Our activities span three core areas: IT Services We build platforms in IT services - acquiring controlling or significant stakes in established, profitable companies and rolling them up into a larger group. We partner with owners and operators to preserve what works while adding the infrastructure and discipline of a platform built to last. Real Estate We invest in, develop, and operate residential, commercial, and mixed-use assets, taking an owner-led approach to development, asset management, and value creation. Capital We allocate capital across public equities, hedge funds, and alternative investments with a long-term mindset, complementing our operating activities. Strategy Our model is simple: operate where we have an edge, allocate where we don’t. Acquire and compound We prefer buying established, profitable businesses over starting from scratch - then compounding them, through operational improvement and further acquisitions. Proven cash flows, existing customer relationships, and experienced teams are the foundation; our job is to strengthen them, not replace them. Decentralized operations, centralized capital Portfolio companies run independently under their own management. What’s centralized is capital allocation: cash generated across the group is redeployed to its highest and best use, wherever that may be. Permanent ownership We have no fund cycles, no exit deadlines, and no pressure to sell. This lets us make decisions on a horizon measured in decades, hold through cycles, and be the buyer of choice for owners who care what happens to their business af"}, {"url": "our-history", "title": "Our History", "text": "Our History Legacy Starwell builds on four generations of entrepreneurship, capital stewardship, and civic leadership - across Los Angeles, New York, and Tel Aviv. Max Factor The entrepreneurial root of the family traces to Max Factor , who built one of the defining consumer brands of the 20th century. From a single Los Angeles shop, he transformed the global cosmetics industry through invention, craftsmanship, and an uncompromising standard of quality - proof that enduring businesses are built product by product, customer by customer. Max Factor David M. Heyman David M. Heyman The tradition of disciplined capital stewardship runs through David M. Heyman , a New York financier and philanthropist who led the New York Foundation for decades. He treated capital as an instrument of long-term responsibility - to institutions, to communities, and to the generations that follow. Real assets, two cities The family’s real estate roots run in parallel on both sides of the ocean. In Los Angeles, Herb Glaser - attorney turned developer - built Glaser Development Company into a commercial real estate developer across Southern California and the Western United States, spanning logistics centers, warehouses, and multifamily properties, alongside decades of leadership in the city’s civic and Jewish institutions. In Tel Aviv, the Buchman family built a textile enterprise and converted it into real estate holdings that grew with the city itself. That tradition continues today through Doron Kochavi , attorney and real estate developer. Doron Kochavi Starwell Starwell is the modern expression of these roots: a private holding company that acquires and builds operating businesses, develops real assets, and allocates capital for the long term. The underlying values are inherited, not invented - integrity, patient ownership, and the responsibility to build things that endure."}, {"url": "our-team", "title": "Our Team", "text": "Our Team Leadership Amit Kochavi Chairman, CEO & Founder Amit founded Starwell Holdings to build a global private investment and operating company that combines long-term capital with operational execution. His career spans technology, real estate, and civic leadership. He is the founder of Doss Israel Ltd. and shareholder in Doss Inc., Senior Advisor to the Mayor of Sderot, and a member of President Herzog’s “Voice of the People” initiative. Amit continues to grow Starwell’s portfolio of platforms and partnerships, focused on building enduring value across cycles and geographies. LinkedIn X Shirly Gur Arie Executive Assistant Shirly supports Starwell’s leadership and day-to-day operations, coordinating across the firm’s platforms and partners to keep the organization running smoothly. LinkedIn"}, {"url": "technology", "title": "IT Services", "text": "IT Services Acquiring controlling or significant stakes in IT services companies, in Israel and beyond. The Thesis The IT services market is large, growing, and highly fragmented. Most of it consists of independent companies built on expertise and long-standing client relationships, without the backing of a larger group. In a technology landscape that never stops changing - cloud migration, artificial intelligence, and successive waves of transformation - businesses need a trusted external technology partner more than ever. Starwell acquires controlling or significant stakes in established, profitable IT services companies. We partner with owners and operators to preserve what works, while building around them the infrastructure and discipline of a platform built to last. 01 Acquire Controlling or significant stakes in established, profitable IT services companies. 02 Integrate Central systems, shared infrastructure, and a consistent standard of service across the portfolio. 03 Grow Operational improvement, talent development, and expanded service capabilities, driving long-term value creation. Portfolio Cormi IT Role: Founder and Majority Shareholder Implementation and integration company specializing in ERP, CRM, and workflow systems for traditional businesses. Website → Doss Inc Role: Strategic Partner Adaptive ERP and data platform with composable architecture. Unifies fragmented workflows across orders, inventory, procurement, production, and finance. Website →"}, {"url": "real-estate", "title": "Starwell Real Estate", "text": "Starwell Real Estate Development and strategic real estate investment across Israel and the United States. Markets Israel Development & Advisory Residential and mixed-use development in Tel Aviv and central Israel, alongside institutional developers and public-sector partners. Focus on urban renewal and projects with structural demand tailwinds. United States Capital Allocation Limited partner investments in value-add multifamily and industrial logistics strategies, alongside institutional operators with demonstrated track records. Selected Experience Beyond Towers ● Tel Aviv, Israel ■ Advisory & Owner Representative (Doron Kochavi) △ Tidhar Group, Union Group, Himnuta–KKL Large-scale mixed-use development comprising office, residential, and commercial space. Total project value estimated at NIS 4–4.5 billion. Urban Renewal Rova 7 — Mevoot Yafo ● Tel Aviv, Israel ■ Strategic Advisory — municipality relations, commercial concept, and marketing strategy △ Keren Reality, Kardan Real Estate (50/50 JV) 55-dunam urban renewal project encompassing approximately 890 residential units, 5,000 sqm of commercial space, 20,000 sqm of office space, and 12 dunams of public area. Approved master plan (May 2023). The Dawson ● Cartersville, Georgia, US ■ Limited Partner △ Wilpon & Co. 192-unit multifamily value-add acquisition. Terminal Logistics Fund II ● US Logistics Markets ■ Limited Partner △ Center Capital Partners Private real estate fund focused on industrial logistics assets across US markets. Website → Portfolio Kochavi Real Estate Portfolio ● Tel Aviv, Israel ■ Portfolio-level management, advisory, and future development planning △ Developer: Doron Kochavi Multi-decade development and investment portfolio built by Doron Kochavi, encompassing over 750 units across more than 20 buildings in Tel Aviv."}, {"url": "capital", "title": "Starwell Capital", "text": "Starwell Capital The capital allocation arm of Starwell Holdings - deploying capital across private equity, public markets, hedge funds, and real estate. Approach Patient, conviction-driven capital allocation across private equity, public markets, and alternative strategies. Starwell Capital oversees the firm’s external capital deployment. The mandate spans private equity, long-term public market holdings, allocations to long-strategy hedge funds, and real estate. We invest with a long time horizon and concentrate where we have genuine conviction. 01 Private Equity Private equity investments in buy-out and roll-up strategies, acquiring and improving traditional businesses through operational, financial, and technological efficiency. 02 Public Markets Long-term concentrated holdings in public companies where the firm has deep conviction in the business and management team. 03 Hedge Funds Selective allocations to long-strategy hedge funds with differentiated process and consistent risk-adjusted performance. 04 Real Estate Capital allocations to real estate funds and structures as part of a diversified long-term portfolio. Portfolio Pioneers — Healthcare Staffing AI Roll-Up Role: Investor AI-native roll-up of healthcare staffing agencies, modernizing legacy operators with proprietary AI to automate workflows and dramatically improve recruiter output. Website → Kodiak Holdings Role: Investor A long-term partner for aspiring small business owners, backing the next generation of American owner-operators with equity financing and support across due diligence, transaction structuring, capital raising, and ongoing operations. Website → Legion Holdings Role: Investor AI-native growth buyout firm investing in business services companies, modernizing their operations with AI, and compounding value through disciplined M&A. Website → Noked Capital Hedge fund allocation. Hazavim Hedge fund allocation."}, {"url": "news", "title": "News", "text": "News News & Insights Company news, market commentary, and updates on our investments. All Real Estate Company News Real Estate Dec 21, 2025 Lipa Meir to Rent Offices in Beyond Tower for 11 Million NIS Per Year Lipa Meir & Co. is leaving Amot Investments House in Tel Aviv to lease 7,000 sqm of office space across 4 floors in the Beyond Tower project from Tidhar, Union, and Himnuta. Read More → Company News Jun 3, 2025 Circles Merges Operations with U.S.-Based Doss Circles is merging its operations with U.S.-based Doss and will become the Israeli sales and marketing center for the company. Read More → Company News May 29, 2025 חברת Circles מתמזגת עם Doss האמריקאית חברת Circles מתמזגת עם Doss האמריקאית ותהפוך למרכז הפיתוח הישראלי שלה. עמית כוכבי ימונה למנהל הפיתוח הגלובלי. Read More → Real Estate May 6, 2025 Lee & Associates – Atlanta Facilitates Sale of 28-Acre Industrial Site to Terminal Logistics Center Capital's IOS platform, Terminal Logistics, has acquired a 28-acre site in Gainesville, GA. Read More → Real Estate Sep 4, 2024 גבעתיים על הגובה: המגדל שהפך לגבוה בישראל פרויקט ביונד בגבעתיים חצה את גובה 240 המטרים והפך למגדל הגבוה בישראל. בסיום הבנייה יגיע לגובה 320 מטרים. Read More → Real Estate Sep 4, 2024 New Tower Claims Title of Tallest in Israel New tower in Givataim claims title of tallest in Israel, rising to 320 meters with office and residential space. Read More → Real Estate Nov 15, 2022 Meitar Leases 17 Floors in Givatayim Tower Meitar Law Offices leases 17 floors in Givatayim tower for NIS 54 million annually. Read More →"}, {"url": "contact", "title": "Contact", "text": "Contact Get in Touch For inquiries about investment opportunities, partnerships, or potential transactions, please complete the form below. A member of our team will respond promptly. Leave empty: First Name * Last Name * Organization Email * Subject Message What is 10 + 10? Submit Offices Tel Aviv Beyond Towers Giv’atayim, Israel Los Angeles 11601 Wilshire Blvd Los Angeles, CA 90025 USA"}, {"url": "careers", "title": "Careers", "text": "Join Us Careers at Starwell We’re a small, high-conviction team building platforms across IT Services and Real Estate, with passive capital allocation to public markets and alternative assets. We look for people who think long-term and operate with precision. How We Work Long-Term Thinking We build for decades, not quarters. Every decision is made with durability and permanence in mind. Operational Excellence We get into the details. Great outcomes come from rigorous execution and deep domain knowledge. Integrity We say what we mean and do what we say - with partners, portfolio companies, and each other. Entrepreneurial Spirit We are builders. We back people who create things that didn’t exist before. Open Positions Click any role to learn more and apply. All Technology Real Estate Capital & Investments Operations Finance No open positions in this category at the moment. Check back soon or reach out directly at careers@starwellholdings.com . Don’t see the right role? We’re always interested in meeting exceptional people. Send us a note and tell us how you’d contribute. Get in Touch"}, {"url": "sitemap", "title": "Sitemap", "text": "Sitemap Sitemap Every page on the Starwell Holdings website, organized in one place. Company Home About Us Our Team Our History News Careers What We Do IT Services Real Estate Capital Resources Contact Search Sitemap עברית"}];
